{"id":"b8c1d508dc8efefc","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-total-functional-reduction.md","title":"全 oracle 泛函的数值函数归约","display":"df-total-functional-reduction — 全 oracle 泛函的数值函数归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-total-functional-reduction","aliases":["20-df-total-functional-reduction"],"display":"df-total-functional-reduction — 全 oracle 泛函的数值函数归约","chapter":"5","section":"5.6.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Theorem 5.6.4；Definition 3.2.3 的数值输出版本","source_printed_pages":[54,125],"source_pdf_pages":[90,160],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-total-functional-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-total-functional-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-total-functional-reduction — 全 oracle 泛函的数值函数归约"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.6.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 5.6.4；Definition 3.2.3 的数值输出版本"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>54</span><span>125</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90</span><span>160</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 全定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{tt},\\omega}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{tt},\\omega}\\)</span> 是本条引入的自然数值全泛函归约记号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}total-functional-reduction}\\vdash\nf\\le_{\\mathrm{tt},\\omega} A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\\n[\\forall x\\ \\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=f(x)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\forall x\\ \\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}total-functional-reduction}\\vdash\nf\\le_{\\mathrm{tt},\\omega} A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\\n[\\forall x\\ \\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=f(x)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\forall x\\ \\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此关系允许自然数值输出，要求同一程序在每个 oracle 上全定义。它与对函数图的集合 truth-table 归约应分开记；后者的输入还包含候选输出，不能直接充当数值函数的预定全计算。二值函数时与 Nerode 的集合 tt 表征一致。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.6.4；Definition 3.2.3 的数值输出版本；印刷页 54, 125；PDF 第 90, 160 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\mathrm{tt},\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}total-functional-reduction}\\vdash\nf\\le_{\\mathrm{tt},\\omega} A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\\n[\\forall x\\ \\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=f(x)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\forall x\\ \\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow].","display":true}],"bytes":1513,"backlinks":[{"id":"364ab8ad1d9d7918","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-total-functional-reduction]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]；see [[20-df-use]]。"}],"outgoing":["140cce30ee9c16d1"]}